Subject: [PATCH 02411/11362] =?UTF-8?q?[outer-loop]=20fix=20sc25=20replay?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20(L0->L1)=20+=20lp85=20to=20L4=20=E2=80=94=20aggregate=20scor?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ecard=20now=2024=20levels?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Two undercounts in the replay meta-harness, both fixed:

  - sc25: was replaying a stale live-recorded trajectory (experiment_4249) to
    L0. Switched to the E3 reproduction (experiment_4341), whose
    plan_executed_detail.plan_result.executed_steps carries the corrected
    cast-grid coords, and added a WARMUP_GAMES step (sc25's first env.step after
    reset is consumed -- the first-step-after-reset gotcha). Verified: without
    warmup L0, with warmup L1.

  - lp85: was pinned to an L3 re-solve. Re-derived the L1->L4 path with
    solve_adaptered's OfflineSolver + the existing learned verifier (loaded
    READ-ONLY -- no retrain / no checkpoint write, so the conductor's PHASE-C
    checkpoint is untouched), reproduction-gated reached_level=4 reproduced=True,
    saved as results/arc_explore_trajectory_lp85_l4.json (54 moves, replayable).

Aggregate offline scorecard: 22 -> 24 levels across 15 games, matching the
registry's reproducible_total_levels=24. Every game now replays at its true
reproduced level (tn36 L7 via the frame approach, lp85 L4, sc25 L1, rest L1).
Offline, air-gapped, zero quota, nothing submitted.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
